# game/chapters/dlc_end.rpy:926
translate thai chat2_daydlcend_1d2aeb70:

    # GRC "You opened the door so quickly for me, Sunshine."
    GRC "เจ้า​เปิด​ประตู​ให้​ข้า​เร็ว​จัง​เลย​นะ ซัน​ไช​น์"

# game/chapters/dlc_end.rpy:933
translate thai chat2_daydlcend_e579a39c:

    # GRC "Are you ready then?"
    GRC "งั้น​เจ้า​พร้อม​แล้ว​รึ​ยัง?"

# game/chapters/dlc_end.rpy:944
translate thai chat2_daydlcend_81ffd52e:

    # GRC "Why... does that matter?"
    GRC "เรื่อง​นั้น... มัน​สำคัญ​อะไร​ด้วย​เหรอ?"

# game/chapters/dlc_end.rpy:950
translate thai chat2_daydlcend_008afe10:

    # GRC "..."
    GRC "..."

# game/chapters/dlc_end.rpy:952
translate thai chat2_daydlcend_5983b13d:

    # GRC "I like you, Sunshine." id chat2_daydlcend_5983b13d
    GRC "ข้า​ชอบ​เจ้า​นะ ซัน​ไช​น์" id chat2_daydlcend_5983b13d

# game/chapters/dlc_end.rpy:953
translate thai chat2_daydlcend_9ff18376:

    # GRC "I like you so much that 'like' is not a sufficient word."
    GRC "ข้า​ชอบ​เจ้า​มาก​จน​คำ​ว่า 'ชอบ' ไม่​พอ​จะ​อธิบาย​เลย​ด้วยซ้ำ"

